      "id": "claim_899f2eb87b4145a08677ee02108b8089",
      "statement": "celld deploy builds a Wrangler project and writes it to the fleet bucket; config keys are an allowlist (module, main, assets, services, d1/kv/queues/workflows/r2, triggers, vars, migrations, no_bundle, etc.) and anything not modeled is refused rather than silently dropped.",
      "evidence": [
