      "id": "claim_394b08d6d8544a80ad2fca332a82d966",
      "statement": "Worker projects are bundled with esbuild from PATH (overridable with CELLD_ESBUILD), while asset-only projects need no esbuild; the no_bundle key reads the entry as-is because a pre-bundled Vite build would be corrupted by another esbuild pass.",
