    {
      "id": "claim_fd861f105db34c23b122499faf972be1",
      "statement": "A deployment version is the hash of sorted module contents plus the serialized metadata plus the asset index; cron trigger expressions are deliberately not an input, so a version names the code and its bindings while a schedule is configuration layered on top.",
