    {
      "id": "claim_f49ab47eb91b4548b0a2cba1e562e4d7",
      "statement": "A manifest names each required deployment feature (assets, cron, d1, kv, queues, r2, sqlite-vec, wasm, workflows); a node that predates a feature rejects the deployment up front, so a mixed fleet fails at deploy time rather than at worker load.",
