    {
      "id": "claim_4605bcc52ced4dddb1eb1b058ca49f2d",
      "statement": "DeploymentGraph::load resolves the fleet-wide pointer and then walks service-binding targets (via deploy/<script>/current.json) and queue consumers (via their attachments); it refuses a script that resolves twice or a queue attached to a deployment other than the one already loaded.",
